  "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-TW\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/THROWABLE_SPEAR/MP_THROWABLE_SPEAR_Header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"627\"></strong></span></a></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"> throwable Spear 正如它的名字所暗示的那样：它允许投掷矛。<br> </span></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">为什么在 <em>Vanilla Minecraft</em> 中不可能？</span></p>\n    <p>&nbsp;</p>\n    <p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/THROWABLE_SPEAR/MP_THROWABLE_SPEAR_Description.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"169\"></span></p>\n    <p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">从现在开始，您可以使用鼠标轮盘来投掷它们，从远处对敌人造成伤害，并从中获得更多。矛变得比以前更有用和多用途。</span></p>\n    <p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/THROWABLE_SPEAR/MP_THROWABLE_SPEAR_Faq.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"168\"></span></p>\n    <p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>这个模组可以用于模组包吗？</strong></span></p>\n    <p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！只要它仅在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上发布。上传到任何其他平台都违反我们的权利，是完全不允许的。</span></p>\n    <p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">但是，如果您考虑将其添加到您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 模组包中，我们将非常感激！如果您需要任何小更改或有任何疑问，请与我们联系！</span></p>\n    <p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以录制这个模组的视频并在我的频道上展示吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n    <p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然，您可以在您的频道上玩这个模组或我们的任何模组包并制作视频，事实上，我们会非常感激！</span></p>\n    <p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/THROWABLE_SPEAR/MP_THROWABLE_SPEAR_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"168\"></span></p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1437/608/throwable-spears-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1438/610/throwable-spears-5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1438/611/throwable-spears-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n    <p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></a></p>\n    <p>&nbsp;</p>\n    <p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>您需要一个服务器与朋友一起游戏吗？</strong></span></p>\n    <p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/THROWABLE_SPEAR/MP_THROWABLE_SPEAR_Promo.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"253\"></strong></a></p>\n    <p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在寻找一个与朋友一起玩任何模组或模组包的服务器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 是您的解决方案！他们拥有最佳性价比的 Minecraft 服务器，并且如果您点击<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a></strong>，您将享受 25% 的折扣，使用代码“Lupin”。</span></p>\n</body>\n</html>",
